You may use the Aero name to identify the Software and satisfy section 4. No
broader trademark permission or right to claim endorsement is granted.

7. Compliance and termination

Permissions under this license depend on compliance with its conditions. If
you breach a condition, stop the affected activity until the breach is corrected
or the relevant copyright holder authorizes it in writing. Correcting the
breach restores permissions for future compliant activity, but does not erase
liability for earlier unauthorized activity. Recipients who remain compliant
do not lose their permissions solely because a distributor breached this license.

Rights granted for a particular version remain available under this license
while its conditions are met. Publication of a later license version does not
by itself change the license for copies already received under this version.
No rights beyond those expressly granted are implied.

